  unitName: Aerohang
  unitId: 20662
  unitNumber: 1161
  description: A migratory bird native to Ishgria. As time passes, its body and wingspan
    double, and the bird begins to hunt animals its own size or larger. These birds
    usually mate for life once they reach maturity, but there are virtually no visible
    differences between males and females. The foul taste of this bird's meat is
    often mentioned as one of its unique traits. Only those of profoundly unique
    tastes or those on the verge of starvation ever attempt to hunt this bird for
    food.
